flowchart TB
  IN["INPUTS: P0 (buggy C) | N (English request) | P1 (AI-revised C)"]
  S1["Stage 1 - Admission and build views<br/>exact production preprocessing (incl. __SYNTHESIS__),<br/>profile and pragma policy, bodyless-call check,<br/>signature match, global-variable classification"]
  S2["Stage 2 - Interpretation set (never reads P1)<br/>shapes from code + LLM; request typing;<br/>strict / permissive / adversarial readings from >= 2 model families;<br/>computed zones: UB region, nondeterminism region"]
  S3["Stage 3 - Objective validation (uses P0 only)<br/>grammar + UB-free contract code, non-vacuous,<br/>reference valid, bug witness exists, realisable;<br/>examples are recorded, never used to discard"]
  S4["Stage 4 - Cheap differential pre-pass<br/>native P0 vs P1 on boundary + random inputs<br/>with UBSan/ASan; candidate witnesses only"]
  S5["Stage 5 - Formal checking (CBMC + Z3)<br/>common core once, then one check per<br/>equivalence class of interpretations"]
  S6["Stage 6 - Confirmation<br/>REJECT: native replay of witness<br/>ACCEPT: SAT backend + ESBMC where supported<br/>+ sanitizer differential testing"]
  S7{"Stage 7 - Verdict with evidence class<br/>and partitioned report"}
  A["ACCEPT (E-int)<br/>+ conditional + scope"]
  R0["REJECT (E-obj)<br/>computed fact"]
  R1["REJECT (E-int)<br/>violates every interpretation"]
  U["UNDECIDED<br/>+ reason + disagreement input"]
  IN --> S1 --> S2 --> S3 --> S4 --> S5 --> S6 --> S7
  S7 --> A
  S7 --> R0
  S7 --> R1
  S7 --> U
  S1 -- "forbidden construct / view mismatch" --> R0
  S1 -- "unsupported C / interface change" --> U
  S3 -- "no interpretation survives" --> U
